# Blood Hustler: its own "{3}{B}: Target opponent loses 1 life and you gain 1 life" targets an opponent, so activating
# it commits a crime (CR 700.13) and "whenever you commit a crime, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature" triggers,
# resolving first. The Lightning Bolt at Bot2 after it is a second crime the same turn, and the counter ability
# "triggers only once each turn": the Hustler ends 2/2 with one counter. Bot2 at 20 - 1 - 3 = 16, Bot1 at 21.

